{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35637","headline":"早秋山中作 · 李山甫","name":"早秋山中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣枯无路入千峯，肥遯谁谐此志同。\n司寇亦曾遭鲁黜，步兵何事哭途穷。\n桧松瘦健滴秋露，户牖虚明生晚风。\n山思更清人影绝，陇云飞入草堂中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}